Two red-headed sisters created this celebratory day

42
00:01:46.900 --> 00:01:48.240 line:15%
as a way to celebrate their hair

43
00:01:48.240 --> 00:01:50.360 line:15%
and empower their scarlet peers.

44
00:01:50.360 --> 00:01:52.760 line:15%
So let's give a shout out to all our favorite redheads.

45
00:01:52.760 --> 00:01:55.540 line:15%
Prince Harry, looking splendid as always.

46
00:01:55.540 --> 00:01:57.260 line:15%
Lucille ball, the OG, yes!

47
00:01:58.940 --> 00:02:00.220 line:15%
My hero!

48
00:02:00.220 --> 00:02:02.853 line:15%
Elizabeth I, mm, yes.

49
