Sexy cartoon red-head Jessica Rabbit.

50
00:02:06.510 --> 00:02:09.060 line:15%
I'm not naughty, I'm just drawn that way.

51
00:02:09.060 --> 00:02:09.893 line:15%
Ginger Spice.

52
00:02:09.893 --> 00:02:12.070 line:15%
Fun fact, the only Spice Girl that's actually a spice.

53
