61
00:02:30.008 --> 00:02:30.841 line:15%
(audience clapping)

62
00:02:30.841 --> 00:02:31.900 line:15%
That's right.

63
00:02:31.900 --> 00:02:33.240 line:15%
We had the best Halloween, you guys.

64
00:02:33.240 --> 00:02:34.580 line:15%
That was just amazing.

65
00:02:34.580 --> 00:02:35.413 line:15%
All right.

66
00:02:35.413 --> 00:02:38.240
And finally, PopSugar reported on a feline habit

67
00:02:38.240 --> 00:02:41.180
that all cat owners are way too familiar with.

68
00:02:41.180 --> 00:02:44.490
It's when they stick their butts in your face.

69
00:02:44.490 --> 00:02:46.530
It turns out that experts say

70
00:02:46.530 --> 00:02:49.490
