71
00:02:49.490 --> 00:02:50.710 line:15%
Oh!

72
00:02:50.710 --> 00:02:53.670 line:15%
Evolutionarily, it's a vulnerable area,

73
00:02:53.670 --> 00:02:57.050 line:15%
